<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>2000s NBA Theme</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: white;
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          rgba(10, 5, 0, 0.35),
          rgba(10, 5, 0, 0.75)
        ),
        url("nba-2000s.jpg") center top / cover fixed no-repeat;
      background-color: #111;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Dark glass overlay */
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at center, transparent 20%, rgba(0,0,0,.55)),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,140,0,.12), rgba(0,0,0,.55));
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    /* NAVBAR */
    nav {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 18px 7%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 1000;

      background: rgba(15, 7, 0, 0.72);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 174, 0, 0.65);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(255, 106, 0, 0.25);
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      color: #ffb300;
      text-shadow:
        0 0 5px #ff6a00,
        0 0 15px #ff6a00;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: .25s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #ffae00;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff6a00;
    }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 120px 20px 60px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      max-width: 900px;
      padding: 50px 35px;

      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);

      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 174, 0, 0.55);
      border-radius: 25px;

      box-shadow:
        0 0 30px rgba(255, 102, 0, .25),
        inset 0 0 30px rgba(255, 174, 0, .05);
    }

    .era {
      color: #ffae00;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(65px, 13vw, 150px);
      line-height: .8;
      font-weight: 1000;
      letter-spacing: 8px;

      background: linear-gradient(
        #fff2a6,
        #ffb300 35%,
        #ff6a00 70%,
        #9d2200
      );

      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;

      -webkit-text-stroke: 2px rgba(255, 210, 80, .4);

      filter:
        drop-shadow(0 5px 0 #552000)
        drop-shadow(0 0 15px #ff6a00);
    }

    .subtitle {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #eee;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .buttons {
      margin-top: 35px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 15px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .btn {
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 900;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: .25s;
    }

    .primary {
      color: #160900;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffe27a, #ff9500);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 119, 0, .4);
    }

    .secondary {
      color: white;
      border: 1px solid #ffae00;
      background: rgba(255, 130, 0, .12);
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.03);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(255, 119, 0, .4);
    }

    /* CONTENT */
    section {
      padding: 100px 7%;
      background: rgba(5, 3, 2, .76);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 174, 0, .25);
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .section-title h2 {
      font-size: 42px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: #ffb300;
      text-shadow: 0 0 15px #ff6a00;
    }

    .section-title p {
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: #bbb;
    }

    /* CARDS */
    .cards {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 16px;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(255, 143, 0, .16),
          rgba(0, 0, 0, .65)
        );

      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 174, 0, .3);

      box-shadow:
        0 10px 35px rgba(0,0,0,.35),
        inset 0 0 20px rgba(255,140,0,.04);

      transition: .3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      border-color: #ffae00;

      box-shadow:
        0 15px 45px rgba(255, 100, 0, .25),
        0 0 20px rgba(255, 174, 0, .12);
    }

    .card-number {
      font-size: 42px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #ff9500;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff6a00;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin: 12px 0;
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #bbb;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      padding: 35px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #090503;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,174,0,.3);
      color: #888;
    }

    footer strong {
      color: #ffae00;
    }

    /* MOBILE */
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      nav {
        padding: 15px 5%;
      }

      nav a {
        margin-left: 10px;
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 17px;
      }

      .hero-content {
        padding: 35px 20px;
      }

      .subtitle {
        font-size: 14px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 70px 5%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav>
    <div class="logo">NBA // 2000s</div>

    <div>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#era">Era</a>
      <a href="#legends">Legends</a>
    </div>
  </nav>


  <main>

    <section class="hero" id="home">
      <div class="hero-content">

        <div class="era">The Golden Era</div>

        <h1>2000s</h1>

        <p class="subtitle">
          Basketball • Legends • Rivalries • History
        </p>

        <div class="buttons">
          <a class="btn primary" href="#legends">
            Enter The Era
          </a>

          <a class="btn secondary" href="#era">
            Explore
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <section id="era">

      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>The 2000s</h2>
        <p>An era packed with iconic teams, players and moments.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-number">01</div>
          <h3>Dynasties</h3>
          <p>
            The decade was defined by dominant teams,
            championship runs and unforgettable rivalries.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-number">02</div>
          <h3>Superstars</h3>
          <p>
            Kobe, Shaq, LeBron, Duncan, Garnett,
            Iverson and countless other legends shaped the era.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-number">03</div>
          <h3>Rivalries</h3>
          <p>
            Intense matchups and playoff battles made
            the 2000s one of basketball's most memorable decades.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-number">04</div>
          <h3>Legacy</h3>
          <p>
            The style, players and moments of this decade
            continue to influence basketball today.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section id="legends">

      <div class="section-title">
        <h2>Legends</h2>
        <p>The names that defined the decade.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-number">24</div>
          <h3>The Mamba Era</h3>
          <p>
            A generation-defining superstar known for
            relentless competitiveness and iconic performances.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-number">34</div>
          <h3>Dominance</h3>
          <p>
            Power, defense and championship basketball
            became trademarks of the decade.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-number">23</div>
          <h3>The Next Generation</h3>
          <p>
            A new generation of superstars began changing
            the league and setting the stage for the 2010s.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>

  </main>


  <footer>
    <p>
      <strong>NBA 2000s Theme</strong>
      — Built for GitHub
    </p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
